{"availability":"available","full":"designhouseme/CookingTube","name":"CookingTube","description":"Turn any YouTube cooking video into a beautiful recipe, then cook along with it. Gemini AI recipes with step timestamps, watch & cook, kitchen timers, a smart shopping list, PDF and Instagram sharing. Polish & English.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-02T18:33:10Z","updated":"2026-10-05T16:09:44Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://cookingtube.designhouse.me","topics":["ai","cloudflare-d1","cloudflare-r2","cloudflare-workers","cooking","food","gemini","i18n","kitchen-timer","nextjs","pwa","react","recipe-app","recipes","shopping-list","typescript","video-to-recipe","youtube"],"demo":"https://cookingtube.designhouse.me/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:02.405Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:02.405Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-05T19:23:02.405Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:23:02.405Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Turn any YouTube cooking video into a beautiful recipe — then cook along with the video.","Paste a link, give it a minute, and get the ingredients, the steps, timers and the exact moment in the video for every step.","CookingTube needs a model that can actually watch a cooking video, and today Gemini is the one that does it end to end:"],"features":["🎬 From video to plate in about a minute. Paste a YouTube link (Shorts too). AI watches and listens to the video and writes down every ingredient and step.","▶️ Watch & cook. The video sits on top of the recipe. Every step has its timestamp, so one tap shows you exactly how the cook did it, and the step being played lights up.","👩‍🍳 A cooking mode built for messy hands. One big step at a time, swipe or arrow keys, a screen that stays on, and the video clip for the current step.","⏱️ A real kitchen timer